window.products.push({"id":1070112,"name":"Hypnotic Gems 453g 1 lb Lot Rare Tibetan Quartz Points, Wands and Specimens - Large: 1\" and Longer Brand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tO7ScZg7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You are purchasing spectacular Tibetan Quartz Crystals mined by Buddhist Monks from the very small Saramaen Monistary in Tibet. The monks walk to the mining area daily and use only hand tools to extract the crystals which is a very slow process. Hypnotic Gems works directly with the monistary to purchase the entire mine run each time they have enough available to ship and every piece they produce is sent to the Hypnotic Gems warehouse in the USA. Once they arrive, the experts at Hypnotic Gems sort every piece for size and most of the pieces you receive from this listing will be 1 inch or larger which is pefect for crafts, jewelry making, decorations, specimens, and more. Since this is a completely natural product the pieces you receive will vary and you will likely receive some odd shapes, inclusions, some scuffed surfaces or chips, carbon inclusions, enhydros, and a large variety of other possible unique characteristics. Sometimes there are more clear crystals in an order while other times there are more included crystals and we can not guarantee how many of each type you will receive. This is normal with crystals from this location and we want customers to be aware what they receive will not be pefect crystals and every piece received will be unique. If you have any questions about this feel free to message Hypnotic Gems prior to purchasing and we will be happy to answer them for you and help to make sure you get the proper quartz to meet your needs. This item is Hypnotic Gems manufacturer part number HG-TIBET-LG.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91tO7ScZg7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hypnotic Gems","source_asin":"B01JR6FL60","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JR6FL60","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JR6FL60","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
