window.products.push({"id":1070149,"name":"Ana Home Set Of 2 Boho Wall Basket Decor, Wicker Round Bamboo Tray, Decorative Wall Basket Shallow, Basket For Wall, Hanging Serving Tray, Fruit Baske","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-ZvMF84RS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"* PERFECT DIMENSION: Big Basket 13.78 x 13.78 x 1.77 inches - Small Basket 13 x 13 x 1.56 inches * RUSTIC BOHO WALL HANGING DECOR: You can easily hang our rattan wall decor basket on the wall as an eye-catching boho chic wall decor or wall pediment for your kitchen, living room, bedroom, dining room or hallway. Textures and patterns taken from nature will give any room this bohemian touch you are looking for. * BEAUTY AND FUNCTION: Our woven basket wall decor is the beautiful organizer, bread and fruit serving tray or coffee table ornament. Thanks to its beautiful woven pattern, decorative baskets for shelves could be used as a decorative bowl or centerpiece for your dining table. Weaved baskets Decor adds character and a touch of natural, rustic boho beauty to many styles of decor. Home, shops, classroom, craft area, kitchen decorative tray, completely meet your boho room decor and storage needs. * UNIQUE GIFT: The beautiful vintage colorful african baskets for wall makes it an ideal housewarming gift or birthday gift for minimalist, natural lovers or those who love rustic home decor.Not only that, this woven basket is also suitable for other occasions such as Mother's Day, Housewarming, Thanksgiving, Xmas, or New Year... * VIETNAMESE SKILLED CRAFTSMEN: Ana Home woven basket for wall decor are made of bamboo, a plant that’s sustainably grown and easy to harvest. For thousands of years, bamboo is widely used by by masterful skilled Vietnamese artisans to make home furniture and accessories. natural woven basket is a great eco-friendly and sustainable decor and table serving solution. * DURABLE: The round bamboo basket is easy to clean and store. They just simply wash with warm, soapy water and a damp cloth to restore the original glossy bamboo fiber finish and stunning outer color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-ZvMF84RS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANA Home","source_asin":"B09379DKST","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070149","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09379DKST","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09379DKST","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
