window.products.push({"id":1070203,"name":"Shun Cutlery 13-Slot Bamboo Knife Block, Made from Tough, Sustainable Bamboo, Authentic, Japanese Universal Knife Block, Knife Holder for Kitchen Coun","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dIKE5DCHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your kitchen knives beautifully organized with the Shun Cutlery 13-Slot Bamboo Knife Block. This kitchen knife block is made from bamboo, one of the world's most renewable resources. Its attractive, easy to clean and stain resistant. Just wipe it down occasionally with a damp cloth to keep it clean. The natural harness of the bamboo helps it resist knife marks and retain its handsome appearance even under consistent use. It can accommodate up to 11 knives in three 1.6\" slots, four 2.1\" slots, and four 1.2\" slots plus a honing steel and pair of shears. In Japan, the blade is more than a tool – it's a tradition. Housed in Seki City, the heart of the Japanese cutlery industry, Shun Fine Cutlery is dedicated to maintaining this ancient tradition. Each knife is handcrafted by highly skilled artisans to produce blades of unparalleled quality and beauty. We also leverage modern, premium materials and state-of-the-art technology to provide Shun quality to millions of professional chefs and avid home cooks throughout the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dIKE5DCHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shun","source_asin":"B00CMP1QUE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CMP1QUE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CMP1QUE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1070204,"name":"Versailles Home Fashions PP015-19 Bamboo Privacy Panel, 38\" x 68\", Honey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Kt1Fzy0DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Privacy Panel is designed to help individuals and organizations better utilize space with flexible and functional freestanding divider screens. The easy assembly patent-pending frame requires no tools; the entire divider goes together with a simple Allen wrench included in the box. The light-weight design doesn't require permanent fixtures allowing you the flexibility to rearrange your decor at any time. This non-committal installation makes this product ideal for all consumers, particularly for lofts, apartments, campus dorms and open-concept rooms. The large 38-in. wide by 68-in. tall bamboo panel is stretched taut across crossbars creatively designed to glide along the uprights, allowing you to position the panel at exactly the height desired and secure with convenient thumb screws. In addition to the twist n' fit spring tension installation, this product also features an optional anti-tip system. By way of concealed screws installed inside the mounting feet, our Privacy Panel can be securely fastened into place. This extra safety attribute is great for high traffic areas or homes with small children. Our Bamboo Privacy Panel is manufactured in an environmentally conscious way that follows our commitment to our planet. Our eco-friendly, all natural bamboo panels are available in a wide range of colors with coordinating cotton trim. The frame is manufactured from 100% steel and at the end of the products life the entire structure can be 100% recycled. The frame's finish is powder-coated, a process that does not emit volatile organic chemicals (VOC's) typically produced with sprayed paints or finishes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Kt1Fzy0DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Versailles Home Fashions","source_asin":"B016BI80ZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070204","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016BI80ZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016BI80ZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1070205,"name":"Syosaku Japanese Vegetable Knife VG-1 Gold Stainless Steel Mahogany Handle, Nakiri 6.3-inch (160mm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":127.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6133uQKqdaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MASTER CRAFTSMANSHIP - Handcrafted in Sakai Japan, where more than 90% of Japanese professional chef knives are produced. It is produced one at a time manually by highly skilled master artisans. It outperforms industrially mass produced products from every aspect. The master craftsmanship shines through in every single product. The unparalleled performances make you feel standing at the pinnacle of cooking! Sheath is sold separately. RAZOR SHARPNESS - Ready to use out of the box with ruthless sharpness. The core is Takefu VG-1 Gold high carbon stainless steel (HRC 60-62) produced in Fukui Japan. The Warikomi construction gives exceptional sharpness, edge retention, durability, and ease of sharpening at the same time. You can easily feel your upgraded technique level just by using a Syosaku Vegetable (Nakiri) Knife. Hand wash only and regularly sharpen on quality whetstones. VEGETABLE SPECIALIST - The ultra sharp straight blade edge is designed to make a full contact with your cutting surface. It helps you to cut vegetables without sticking together like a thread. You can effortlessly slice delicate vegetables paper-thin, or quickly chop through hearty crisp vegetables. The wider blade is convenient for scooping them up for transfer after chopping. It’s double-edged, so doesn’t matter if you are right handed or left handed. Do not use on granite countertops. DURABILITY AND EASE OF USE - The VG-1 Gold core Warikomi structure is stain & corrosion resistant. The premium Mahogany wood used for the handle is water-resistant and non-slip. You don’t have to worry when it is left wet during its use (recommended to wash and dry after the use). The handle is triple riveted to the full tang, which gives exceptional strength & durability. The ergonomically designed handle and perfectly balanced construction make you comfortable even for a long time use. AESTHETICS AND 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - A simple and elegant design makes your cooking more enjoyable. An elegant Mahogany handle adds more visual accents. It brings refinement and style to any modern kitchen. It’s a perfect gift for your loved one, too. If you don't love our Syosaku Vegetable (Nakiri) Knife, please return within 30 days of purchase for a full refund","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6133uQKqdaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Syosaku","source_asin":"B081CZXYHT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081CZXYHT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081CZXYHT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
