window.products.push({"id":1070209,"name":"Joliyoou Thanksgiving Wreath, Fall Turkey Mesh Wreath with 30 LED Warm White String Lights, Dangling Legs Turkey Wreath Adorned for Autumn Front Door ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h-NAIW1BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AWESOME FALL DAY ELEMENTS: Joliyoou thanksgiving mesh wreath is based in orange, the color for fall day, and decorated with maple leaves, pumpkins, sunflowers, and warm white LED lights. The various festive elements send out great atmosphere of fall day and harvest. TURKEY SITTING ON: The soft stuffed turkey sits on the middle of the wreath, opening its arms, which seems it is going to hug the harvest. Joliyoou turkey wreath is perfect to be hung in our home to celebrate the arrival of Thanksgiving and fall day. 30 LED WARM WHITE LIGHT: Package comes with a string of 30 LED lights separately which is NOT pre-lit on the wreath, so you can decorate the string lights according to your own likes. Finally just connect the string lights and the garland together with the wire, and then turn on the switch, the string of lights will emit very charming warm white light, adding great warm touch to your fall day and thanksgiving. QUALITY & DURABLE: Joliyoou turkey wreath is made of high-quality PVC as the base circle. All the decoration is handmade, so each wreath appears differently. The pictures are for reference only. 2 AAA batteries are required, NOT INCLUDED. So you can hang it anywhere without worrying about if there is a place to plug it in. WONDERFUL HARVEST DECOR: Joliyoou fall wreath is great ideal to hang on your front door, wall, fireplace, window or just place it on your shelves. Apart from being the perfect Thanksgiving decoration, it is also a wonderful fall day gift to be sent to your family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h-NAIW1BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joliyoou","source_asin":"B095SFKHHL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070209","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095SFKHHL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095SFKHHL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
