window.products.push({"id":1070302,"name":"Christmas Tree Collar - Christmas Tree Dress Up Skirt for Christmas Tree Decor, 30-Inch Christmas Tree Ring, Box Packaging, Christmas Tree Bottom Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RkfR4lqPL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"🎁【WHY YOU NEED THIS】- PTHTECHUS's three-dimensional Christmas tree skirt has been upgraded. It covers a small area and the three-dimensional shape makes PTHTECHUS's Christmas tree skirt not easy to step on. It can isolate pets, prevent pets from climbing on the Christmas tree skirt, and will not stick to pet hair. 🎄【SOLVE YOUR WORRIES】- The traditional Christmas tree skirt is spread on the ground like a carpet. It covers a large area, and the fabric has many wrinkles, which makes it very messy. There are people coming and going around the Christmas tree. The traditional tree skirt is stepped on and dirty in a few days, And the cloth can easily stick to the pet's hair, making it very dirty. Usually it must be replaced after one year of use. 🎁【SUPER FAST INSTALLATION】- It only takes 3 minutes to install the PTHTECHUS Christmas tree skirt. You only need to splice the 6 boards supporting the tree skirt. When you don’t need to use it, you only need to take it apart and put it back in the box, will not take up a lot of storage space. The traditional Christmas tree collar uses several plastic tubes to support, not firm and the surface is uneven, which is very unsightly and difficult to assemble, takes more than 20 minutes. 🎄【100% SATISFACTORY QUALITY】- PTHTECHUS Christmas tree skirt is composed of two parts. The outside is a tree skirt, which is exquisitely sewn. The fabric is covered with edging. The inside is a PC board. The material is firm. It will not fall even if pushed by someone and can fully support the tree skirt. This makes the tree skirt flat and without wrinkles. The packaging is a Christmas gift box, with a handle on the box, which can be carried directly. 🎁【THE PERFECT CHRISTMAS GIFT 】- PTHTECHUS Christmas tree skirt is exclusively designed for Christmas gift box packaging, which is very suitable for parents, relatives, friends, neighbors, etc. It is also very suitable for buying back at home by yourself. When installed on the Christmas tree, it will have a special Christmas atmosphere!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RkfR4lqPL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PTHTECHUS","source_asin":"B08K8HKFS3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070302","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K8HKFS3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K8HKFS3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
