window.products.push({"id":1070450,"name":"Diamond X-Back Folding 30\" Barstool, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/311XH2RS46L._AC_.jpg","description":"Slide up to the counter on the Diamond X-Back Folding Counter Stool. This beautifully crafted item has an elegant X design on the back in oil-rubbed bronze that is sure to complement the design on any bar area. It easily folds together and pulls apart for a quick and easy set-up when company is expected. This bronze with beige microfiber seat cushion counter bar stool is both convenient and stylish. The neutral color will blend with any color scheme, while the plush cushion offers a comfortable place to sit. This counter stool is just the right height for a kitchen island or a high-top table. Diamond X-Back Folding Counter Stool: Oil-rubbed bronze finish Bronze with beige microfiber cushion counter bar stool has a diamond X-Back Design Folding bar stool Beige microfiber seat cushion Easy to assemble","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/311XH2RS46L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B01MY4F9BO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MY4F9BO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MY4F9BO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1070451,"name":"Silicone Muffin Pan & Cupcake Pan - 12 Cup and 24 Cup Non Stick Muffin Tin - 100% Food Grade, Pinch Test Approved Heavy Duty 320g Silicone Mini Muffin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zsOV5gHgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Manufacturers are still allowed to use silicone rubber with fillers for their muffin pans and other silicone product. While silicone rubber is considered 'food-safe,' at Farm Table Chef, we disagree. Our silicone is not like silicone rubber. It is 100% pure BPA-free with no additives and no fillers. Want to test that? Pinch or twist our silicone pan. It won't turn white because our pans do not have silicone filler. We use only the highest quality LFGB European-grade silicone which is pinch/twist test approved and heat resistant up to 450°F. That means baked goods won't stick and won't smell or taste like chemicals. Our pans are also heavy-duty because they are made of a 320 gram weighted silicone (compared to competitors who sell 200 gram weighted silicone). Our pans are not flimsy and will last for years to come, so you can buy knowing that it’s an investment. SILICONE VS TRADITIONAL METAL PANS 1. Silicone pans don't require a baking liner. 2. Silicone is extremely flexible. Baked goods will easily release as the cup is pushed inside out. 3. Pure silicone does not have the chemicals found in metal pans, so nothing leaches into baked goods. 4. Silicone is freezer, dishwasher, microwave and oven safe. 5. Pure silicone is durable, long-lasting and does not stain. COMMITTED TO YOUR SATISFACTION Farm Table Chef Brand is 100% committed to your satisfaction. If for any reason you are not happy with your order, contact us. We will make it right for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zsOV5gHgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Farm Table Chef","source_asin":"B076X33PJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070451","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076X33PJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076X33PJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
