window.products.push({"id":1070651,"name":"NIXT CLOCK - (no Tubes) IN14 Nixie Clock DIY KIT Power Supply Remote Temp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aQywiGTBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dimension: ~5x8x20CM Power input: 12V1A 5.5mm/2.1mm (9V-18V, Higher than 10Watt) Soldering diagram: (as labeled on the PCB and given online document links) Functions: Alarm Remote Control Thermometer Save setting when power off Led breath light from the bottom All led can turn off Sleep mode setting to extend tube lifetime Breathing or flash tube text Anti-cathode poisoning system USB programmer connection to PC (for update firmware) 3 modes of switch digits GPS sync time function (GPS signal receive slowly, need 3-5 min, may need to put the GPS module at window side or outdoor) Format: 12/24 Hour DDMMYY MMDDYY YYMMDD C / F temp format Reference of the IN-14 Nixie Tube: 54mm*19mm for the glass body 18*8.5mm for the text >5000-20000 hour lifetime (this clock has auto sleep function) The time module DS3231 - extremely accurate I2C real-time clock (RTC) with an integrated temperature-compensated crystal oscillator (TCXO) and crystal. Temp function is not used, we use an external temp sensor on this clock. Contents: 1 SMD Parts Soldered PCB board, need to solder through-hole parts 1 Set of through-hole parts 1 Power Supply (12V well-branded power fit your country power type) 1 Remote controller (cr2025 battery not included) 1 set of socket pins for in14 nixie tubes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aQywiGTBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NIXT CLOCK","source_asin":"B07TYKQ2YH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070651","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TYKQ2YH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TYKQ2YH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
