window.products.push({"id":1070672,"name":"Wooden Muddler for Cocktails 10 Inches, Drink Muddler for Home and Bar, Sturdy Wood, Professional Bar Tool for Mojitos, Fruit Drinks, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hawqCn-qL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Essential Tool: This 10” muddler is a basic bartender tool. You can also use it at home, making a cocktail for yourself anytime. Whether it’s used at home or bar, this wood muddler would be a nice accessory. Sturdy Material: The muddler for cocktail is made of Beech. This tree is sturdy and impact resistant and not easily deformed or break. The high-quality material makes it long life cycle even in a frequent usage condition. Easy to Use: Compared with most stainless steel muddler, the wooden one could grip more tightly due to the friction of the surface. It also has a nice touch with it. Your hand will never feel freeze when you smash the ice. Natural: No metal, No nylon, No plastic. This wood muddler only contains natural material, totally no harm to human body. Consequently, it's more eco-friendly than other drink muddlers. Cocktails with Flavor: This muddler allows you to crush any fruit, spice, mint, herbs. It helps you to produce wonderful cocktail and drink with tempting flavor. Perfect for bar, home, cafe. Hand wash only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hawqCn-qL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"datsto","source_asin":"B0B2KPK51J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070672","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2KPK51J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2KPK51J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1070673,"name":"Aspen Rustic Cherry Kitchen Island by Home Styles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":732.08,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lYKnqxYbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This create ambiance with a perfect balance of warmth and style with the aspen collection. Mahogany solid and cherry veneer are warmed with a rustic cherry finish while recessed door panels, a profiled edge top and bold molding detail draw the eye deeper in. Storage function can be found in the four storage drawers and a storage cabinet with one adjustable shelf but what makes this island really unique is the hidden sliding mechanism connected to the back two posts. The mechanism provides easy mobility and independent movement of the two posts for expansion of the breakfast bar. Either with the breakfast bar closed or in use, this piece has a polished look by being consistently styled on both the approach and working sides. With the breakfast bar extended, the top surface depth expands from 26-3/4-inch to 39-inch. Measures 48-inch width by 26-3/4-inch depth by 36-inch height.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lYKnqxYbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Styles","source_asin":"B005H7YZ3O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005H7YZ3O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005H7YZ3O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
