window.products.push({"id":1070755,"name":"Urban Villa Laundry Bags Canvas|Dirty Clothes Travel Laundry Bag|Machine Washable|Reusable College Hostel Hamper Liner Bag for Garments Delicates Ling","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GcYMJqCeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton Imported SAFE COTTON : Urban Villa takes pride in quality cotton delivered in all the range of products. Cotton is the safest material for Laundry bags. Be assured to toss in Delicates like Bra, Underwear garments, Lingerie, Baby Clothes. Light weight bag makes it easy to carry for travel, Sports practice, Camping etc. ORGANISER : Leave old clothes for days without worry of smell and hygiene issues. Cotton is good Absorbent for damp clothes and lets airflow without developing mould and smell. Dust free bags makes it great to stack up all washed seasonal clothes like sweaters when you don't need them. LARGE SIZE: Urban Villa Laundry bags are made of 100% Cotton and the drawstring makes it easy to hold upto 2~3 loads of Laundry. Can also be used to Store toys, Shoes, Delicate Garments. MACHINE FRIENDLY: Urban Villa Laundry Bags are Pre washed and made from premium quality cotton, When you need to wash them, confidently toss them in the washing machine, and they’ll come out looking good as new, no shrinkage! Easy Maintenance,No hassle. CUSTOMER CARE: We care deeply for our products and your rights. In case of complaints go to your order history and click on return/refund or message us via the ‘contact seller’ option and we will immediately resolve your issue.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GcYMJqCeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Urban Villa","source_asin":"B0862DS16P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070755","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0862DS16P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0862DS16P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1070756,"name":"Teal Home Cervical Memory Foam Pillow, Neck Contour Cervical Orthopedic Pillow for Neck Shoulder and Back Pain Relief，Ergonomic Bed Pillow for Sleepin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O6aUrbhuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REDUCE NECK & BACK PAIN-Do you wake up with a stiff neck and sore shoulders? Our memory foam pillow is designed to alleviate these common sleep issues by providing proper neck and head support. The unique contour design conforms to your head and neck, reducing pressure points and promoting proper spinal alignment. Say goodbye to neck and shoulder pain! ERGONOMIC DESIGN-Ergonomically designed neck pillows can help provide optimal support for the head, neck, and shoulders, evenly distributing important pressure points to reduce head pressure. This contour pillow also allows us to sleep in a comfortable position, ensuring the airway is unobstructed, waking up feeling rested and refreshed is much easier with a pillow designed to support the body in its natural position. SUITABLE FOR DIFFERENT SLEEPING POSTURES - Do you like to sleep on your side? Or maybe you prefer sleeping on your back or stomach? No problem! The Teal Home memory foam pillow is perfect for every sleeping posture. It will support your head and neck in whatever position you choose, giving you the best possible night's sleep. SAFE AND ODORLESS MEMORY FOAM - Worried about safety standards? So are we! That's why our memory foam is 100% safe and odorless. You'll never have to worry about chemical smell or off-gassing with this pillow. Buy with confidence knowing that your health is our top priority. TWO Heights - Design For Back & Side Sleeping: Size 23.6*15.7*(3.5-4.3) inches, Back sleepers with cervical issues can sleep on the higher side (4.3inches) of the pillow with two horns as this side provides better support for the head and cervical, to keeps your neck correctly aligned with the rest of your body. All the other back/side sleepers can sleep on the lower side (4.3 inches). WHAT YOU GET - A 100% memory foam pillow measuring 23.6*15.7*（4.3-3.5） inches. The pillowcase of this pillow is durable, breathable, and machine washable. Friendly customer service. GREAT GIFT CHOICE - This neck support pillow is the perfect gift for anyone who wants a more comfortable and restful sleep. It's ergonomic design makes it ideal for people with neck and shoulder pain, making it the perfect solution for a better night's sleep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61O6aUrbhuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Teal Home","source_asin":"B0BR11MDM5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR11MDM5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR11MDM5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
