window.products.push({"id":1070783,"name":"Portable Mini USB Humidifier, 320ml Small Cool Mist Humidifier, Personal Desktop Humidifier for Car Bedroom Travel Office , Auto Shut-Off, 2 Spray Mod","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.12,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gVxItFKDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PORTABLE MINI HUMIDIFIER】This mini car humidifier is small and light which is easy to carry. The large volume of 320ml and the fine spray are used to increase the air humidity. Very suitable to use in bedroom, office, living room, car and travelling. 【35°ERGONOMIC DESIGN】Our FoPcc portable humidifier owns a 35°nozzle which is better to spray directly to you and make your skin more moisturized. This design is also great to avoid leaking and reduce the possibility of accidental spills. 【ONE BUTTON CONTROL ALL】First click the spray button for continuously spraying 10 hours. Second click the spray button for intermittently spraying (stop 2s) 20 hours. Click the spray button for the third time, turn off the spray. If you want to turn on the light, long press the button for 2s. 【SAFE & AUTO SHUT OFF】There is a water level window that help you to check the water capacity. After running for 8 hours, it will automatically shut off to protect the device and continue to use it after restarting. Once the water runs out, it will also auto shut-off. 【IMPORTANT NOTE】①Please do not use essential oils, perfume, distilled water, which will cause the cotton swab to clog and the Humidifier to be unusable. Tap water or mineral water is recommended.②Please soak the cotton swab for 3-5 minutes until it is fully soaked before using. ③If the humidifier is not spraying, please directly contact us to click Sold by FoPcc Store.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gVxItFKDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FoPcc","source_asin":"B08M99SB8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070783","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M99SB8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M99SB8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
