window.products.push({"id":1070882,"name":"Mister Rogers Neighborhood Ceramic Coffee Mug | Won't You Be My Neighbor | Holds 15 Ounces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bbp5Xg80L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HELLO THERE, NEIGHBOR If you're looking for the most wholesome coffee mug on the planet, well this mug may just be a contender. Featuring the legendary Mister Rogers, this mug offers an overview of Mister Rogers' Neighborhood with Mister Rogers himself overlooking the town of Make-Believe, inspiring us to be better neighbors towards one another. The orange and yellow sunburst reminds us how happy Mister Rogers' neighborhood can truly be. Wake up each morning with a cheerful cup of coffee from the neighborhood. LOADED WITH NOSTALGIA Fans who grew up with Mister Rogers will love having this mug among their collection of favorite drinkware. The memorable line featured on the mug will have fans gushing at the wholesome memories and lessons that they hold so dear in regards to Mister Rogers. A wonderful and unique treasure, this mug will make a perfect addition to your collection or a thoughtful present to the Mister Rogers fan in your life. Take a trip down memory lane and grab this Mister Rogers cup today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bbp5Xg80L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Surreal Entertainment","source_asin":"B07YDNKRZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YDNKRZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YDNKRZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1070883,"name":"yazi Side-by-Side Refrigerator Full Door Cover Decal Vinyl Removable Sticker Kitchen Art Décor Cactus 20x71 inches by 2 Pieces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vrqbQ7n+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Usage:A beautiful design art sticker will beautify your house or shop more vibrant. The picture is of high quality and removable,it is a great choice for your house as a creative refrigerator decoration,also is a nice gift choice when you go to visit friends.Benefits of Using Our Product:1).HIGH-QUALITY VINYL-- the refrigerator sticker art are made of high-quality vinyl, which guarantees an average lifespan of over two years for your satisfaction.2).REALISTIC LOOKING--Thickness reach 3mm,the surface covered a diamond film makes the texture better and keep a high color reduction.3).WATERPROOF,CLEANABLE AND WASHABLE--a water resistant matte lamination makes the sticker easy to scrub.It can be washed with gentle pressure and a soft damp cloth.4).EASY TO USE-- unlike cheaper removable decal stickers, these sticker home decor can be easily applied, removed or repositioned as desired. Just peel and stick, and transform your refrigerator quickly and easily.5).NO MARKS-- removing the removable decal stickers will never leave marks or residues behind, and it won't remove paint from your refrigertor door either.Installation Guide:1.wipe the refrigerator sucface,removing the dust and any abvious contaminants;2.Lay the graphic image side down on a flat surface.Pull back about 2 inches of the liner.Sharply crease the liner; 3.Align the graphic on the refrigerator and use finger presuure to take it in place; 4.Secure the top of the graphic by brushing from the center out.Methodically move down the graphic,continue to brush from center out.Gently pull liner down to remove as you go,until the whole graphic has been adhered.Suggestion:Remove the handle before pasting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vrqbQ7n+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"yazi","source_asin":"B072N7PSS1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072N7PSS1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072N7PSS1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
