window.products.push({"id":1070915,"name":"Lytmi Neo-Pop HDMI 2.0 Sync Box & TV LED Backlight Kit, Immersion Ambient Lighting Strips for 66-90 Inch TV, Compatible with Alexa & Google Assistant,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m5vmb7Y+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Immersive TV Lighting Experience】: Sync your TV backlight color with movies and video games for thrilling home entertainment. Expand your home theater with it and make your tv light strips dance, flash, dim, and brighten with the content on your screen. 【Compatibility】: Neo cannot work with smart TV built-in APP, a HDMI input is required. All you need to do is just pair it with any HDMI devices, Apple TV, Xbox, PlayStation, or Laptop to transform your living room into a theatrical piece of art. 【Network & Video Solution】: WiFi - 802.11 b/g/n/ 2.4 GHz HDMI - 2.0b with HDCP 2.2 Video resolution - Up to 4K 60Hz HDR10, Dolby Vision Supported - Bluetooth for installation with WIFI. 【Accurate Color Reproduction】: Each NEO light strip has 48 ARGB LEDs/m. Each LED can display a different color and brightness than its neighbors. NEO can process up to 500-pixel dots, ensuring a high accuracy of color reproduction via the light strips in sync mode. 【Easy Installation】 : Easy to install, set up, and use. Simple setup and straight-forward controls makes it easy to get started with the Lytmi Neo HDMI Sync Box. Use the dedicated app to customize your smart lighting effects and the sync box’s settings. 【Fit 0-120” Screen Size】 : The LED strip light comes in three sizes. Moreover, you can customize the length of the light strips by cutting it, thus making it easy to attach to the back of a 0~120” TV screen. The NEO box can auto calibrate the light strips.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m5vmb7Y+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lytmi","source_asin":"B09VKLX7K4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070915","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VKLX7K4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VKLX7K4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1070916,"name":"Factory Entertainment Kiss - Mount Kiss More Polystone Statue Full Scale","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YMmzZUqUL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer KISS Mount Kiss more Polystone Sculpture: Featuring the Demon, The Starchild, The Spaceman and The Catman, this polystone monolith is a fitting tribute to one of the most influential rock and roll bands of all time. Each sculpture is handcrafted in granite effect resin and can be displayed free standing or mounted on a wall. A numbered limited edition of 2000 pieces. Mount Kiss more measures 15” wide x 10” high x 4” deep. The Mount Kiss more Story, by Douglas Hildebrandt: My name is Douglas Hildebrandt and I created Mount Kiss more. I initially created it as a personal project, but I liked it so much I made an extra one and sent it to Gene Simmons as a gift. Sometime later I was amazed to see it in one of the display cases in Gene’s Office on his reality TV show. I was even more stunned to then get a phone call from Gene himself to thank me. He also gave me some pointers and advice on getting my ideas and designs produced. I then hooked up with Factory Entertainment who shared my vision and had the license to produce decorative KISS items, they commissioned me to produce a master pattern for this limited edition run. I have been a KISS fan most of my life, loving their music, style and the four iconic characters they created. Being a musician and artist myself, KISS has always struck me as one of the most unique and influential rock and roll bands. As an artist I wanted to create something very special to honor KISS. I wanted to imitate the real Mount Rushmore, so it is deliberately styled to replicate the look of carved granite. I also wanted the faces to look like a scaled down version of what KISS would really look like if they were actually carved in epic proportions sixty feet high into the side of a mountain. So I also tried to emulate the sculpting style used by the sculptors who created the real Mount Rushmore. I think it is a fitting tribute and true testament to one of the greatest bands of our time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YMmzZUqUL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Factory Entertainment","source_asin":"B0073XAU7K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070916","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0073XAU7K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0073XAU7K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
