window.products.push({"id":1070982,"name":"Large Food Storage Containers with Lids - 6 Piece Plastic Kitchen & Pantry Organization for Cereal, Flour, Sugar - BPA Free Airtight Cereal Container ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91f2INH8miL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ 3 Size Combinations Fit Your Needs - Our cereal containers provide a higher total storing capacity unlike most others on Amazon. Includes 2 large container (16.9 cups /4.0 liters), 2 medium containers (12.68 cups /3.0 liters), 2 small containers (6.97 cups /1.65 liter). These airtight food containers come in a wide variety of shapes and sizes for all your storage needs.Perfect for storing spaghetti, cereal, flour, sugar, oats, pasta, rice, coffee, snacks, nuts and other dry goods. ✅ Premium Package - Your complete bundle comes with 6 BPA-free premium food storage containers,1 chalkboard Marker, 16 reusable chalkboard labels and a 4 pc Measuring Spoon Set, allowing you to organize your pantry like never before. ✅ BPA Free and Food Grade Material - Fooyoo pantry storage containers are made of durable plastic, BPA free, which have a longer life than many other brands plastic containers. Clear containers make it convenient to see what’s inside, you can easily get what you want without opening every container. ✅ Airtight Containers Keep Food Fresh - The side-locking lids with silicone gasket make these cereal containers airtight, and the top flips open easily. Airtight storage system will always keep your food dry and fresh. ✅ Space Saving Design - These durable cereal containers storage have been especially designed to minimize space, they are stackable and will easily fit into your refrigerator, freezer or cupboard which enables you to get the kitchen organized and frees up space in the pantry. These clear containers are also easy to clean, extremely user friendly and ready to use, but these containers are not dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91f2INH8miL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOOYOO","source_asin":"B09CQ166WF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070982","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CQ166WF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CQ166WF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
