window.products.push({"id":1070996,"name":"Kitchenaid Tilting Stand Mixer Tilt 4.5-Quart ksm85pbob All Metal Housing and Gears Silver Metallic with Stainless Steel Bowl Tilt Artisan Style.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K3jAIa8tL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This KitchenAid Stand Mixer has a strong 300-watt motor that delivers the power to handle the heaviest mixtures, and mix large batches easily. The 4.5-quart polished stainless steel bowl with ergonomic handle is big enough to handle large batches of heavy mixtures. Its ergonomically designed handle is contoured to fit the hand and makes lifting the bowl more comfortable. The flat beater, dough hook, and the professional wire whip add to the versatility of the mixer. The flat beater is the ideal accessory for mixing normal to heavy batters. From cake mixes to firm cookie dough, the flat beater mixes quickly and thoroughly. The dough hook mixes and kneads yeast dough, saving both time and the effort of hand-kneading. The wire whip incorporates the maximum amount of air in whipped mixtures for fluffier whipped cream and angel food cakes. The tilt-back mixer head allows for easy access to bowl and beaters. Flat beater: Quickly and throughly mixes ingridients for everthing from pancakes for breakfast to specialty treats for the holidays. Dough hook mixex and kneads yeast doughs, saving the effort of hand kneading. Wire whip will incorporate the mixtures for fluffier whipped cream and lighter angel food cakes. 300-watt mixer with 10 speeds; 4.5-quart stainless steel bowl accommodates large batches of heavy mixtures. Tilt-back head for easy access to mixture Includes flat beater, dough hook, and wire whip; pouring shield not included Power output: 300 watts Speeds: 10 Bowl capacity: 4.5 quarts Body material: Metal Bowl material: Stainless steel Manufacturer: KitchenAid Tilt-up head: Yes Dough hook: Yes Pouring shield: No Outlets for attachments: Yes Included accessories: Flat beater, dough hook, wire whip","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K3jAIa8tL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B00IZQMQ5S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1070996","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IZQMQ5S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IZQMQ5S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
